{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13311030","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13311030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1331103001:1":{"text":"난 안 무서워. 네 말은 전부 다 가짜잖아! 지난번에도 우물에 살아있는 시체가 있다고 했는데, 어른들은 아무 일도 없이 계속 그 우물에서 물을 길었잖아.","source_cn":"我才不怕，你说的不是真的，上次你说井里有活死人，可大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CFEE84C2AB8619A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1331103002:1":{"text":"그러니까 네 말은 더 안 믿을 거야!","source_cn":"所以我不会相信你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD73A34A2F1D644A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331103003:1":{"text":"이번에는 진짜야! 진짜로 살아있는 시체가 눈사람인 척 마을로 섞여들어 오는 걸 봤어!","source_cn":"这次是真的！我真的看到一个活死人伪装成雪人，然后混进了村子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x107D86DB3001DA95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小孩拉里莎":{"text":"아이 라리사","source":"小孩拉里莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小孩尤金":{"text":"유진","source":"小孩尤金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}